<title>JAPAN: Kinki Coca-Cola - 1996 parent results.</title>
<headline>Kinki Coca-Cola - 1996 parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		152.06		vs	  143.81</p>
<p> Operating	    8.95		vs	    8.32</p>
<p> Current		8.50		vs	    8.46</p>
<p> Net		    1.51		vs	  963    million</p>
<p> EPS		   25.44 yen	  vs	   16.22 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     59 million	  vs	  59 million</p>
<p> Ord div	     15.00 yen	  vs	   13.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kinki Coca-Cola Bottling Co Ltd is a major Coca-Cola bottler based in Osaka.</p>
